prs.body:
Fixes #3577.

With this, one can `rustup self uninstall` and instead https://zero-to-nix.com/start/install/, and possibly https://direnv.net (optional; or just `nix develop`), then `direnv allow`, one gets an up-to-date Cargo version to work on this project. Any other than Cargo of [the 120000 Nix packages](https://search.nixos.org/packages) required by Bat could be added to `flake.nix`.

@keith-hall I'm not sure you'd welcome this?

